{"id":"52654f9b-8cbd-4191-8eaa-800ea4901d19","title":"虚拟屏启动设置失败","createdAt":1788431600840,"updatedAt":1788433690650,"messages":[{"id":"d1d9d576-5ef9-454a-b9f6-9b574494624c","role":"user","content":"Use vscreen_launch to open com.android.settings, read it with vscreen_screen, tap the first list item, then vscreen_close. Report each step briefly. TASKX2","toolCalls":[],"error":false,"ts":1788431603019},{"id":"18b56714-f92e-48e1-add0-b0dae453e82e","role":"assistant","content":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_0_0","name":"tools_enable","argumentsJson":"{\"group\": \"extended\"}"}],"error":false,"reasoning":"I need to enable the extended tools group first since vscreen_launch and related tools are part of that category. There's also a note about accessibility services being disabled on the Meizu system, which could potentially block these operations, but I'll proceed with enabling the tools and see what happens.\n","ts":1788431605594},{"id":"3e990a1c-5a05-4f99-b38c-741be1f9e6d5","role":"tool","content":"已启用 extended 工具组，相关工具已注入（本会话保持）。现在可以直接使用该组的工具。","toolCalls":[],"toolCallId":"call_0_0","toolName":"tools_enable","error":false,"ts":1788431605597},{"id":"a8e30ebc-6025-40f1-8a34-14cee32aa0b2","role":"assistant","content":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_0_0","name":"vscreen_launch","argumentsJson":"{\"target\": \"com.android.settings\"}"}],"error":false,"reasoning":"I've enabled the extended tools. Now I'm going to execute the task that the user requested: vscreen_launch com.android.settings → vscreen_screen → tap the first list item → vscreen_close.","ts":1788431778554},{"id":"e39f5d63-e5f0-4388-82f3-45958c55c9b4","role":"tool","content":"目标 App 未出现在虚拟屏（窗口可能被重投递回主屏或 App 拒绝多屏）。请先关闭主屏上的该 App 后重试；仍失败则改用主屏 screen/tap 工具流程。","toolCalls":[],"toolCallId":"call_0_0","toolName":"vscreen_launch","error":true,"ts":1788431786647},{"id":"9e21f9f3-8483-4b57-8249-825177cecb0d","role":"user","content":"Call vscreen_launch with target com.android.settings. TASKX3","toolCalls":[],"error":false,"ts