ith the same target since the user is asking for it.\n","ts":1788432910040},{"id":"6c78e963-9814-48c8-85da-d9fcb6436093","role":"tool","content":"目标 App 正在主屏运行：无法投递到虚拟屏（系统会把启动送回主屏实例）。请让用户先关闭主屏上的该 App，再重试；不要擅自 force-stop 打断用户当前操作。","toolCalls":[],"toolCallId":"call_0_0","toolName":"vscreen_launch","error":true,"ts":1788432911040},{"id":"1c4a8eab-4eef-4d9a-a300-248066269361","role":"assistant","content":"再次调用 `vscreen_launch(com.android.settings)` → **仍然失败**。\n\n- 原因不变：设置 App 还在主屏运行，系统拒绝将其投递到虚拟屏。\n- 需要你做的：在主屏上退出/关闭\"设置\"（回到桌面即可），然后告诉我重试。\n- 我不会擅自 force-stop 你的设置进程，避免打断你主屏上的操作。","toolCalls":[],"error":false,"reasoning":"Still failing. The Settings app is still running on the main screen. I should report this concisely. The user keeps repeating the same instruction (TASKX3). I shouldn't blindly retry over and over. I'll report the failure and the necessary conditions.","promptTokens":21428,"completionTokens":187,"durationMs":4932,"model":"qwen3.8-flash","ts":1788432913185},{"id":"12d677e6-bb60-4159-a902-ad6ba1adf628","role":"user","content":"Call vscreen_launch with target com.android.settings, then vscreen_screen. TASKX4","toolCalls":[],"error":false,"ts":1788432968966},{"id":"0e45af41-fae0-43c6-aca7-4e022b705d18","role":"assistant","content":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_0_0","name":"vscreen_launch","argumentsJson":"{\"target\": \"com.android.settings\"}"}],"error":false,"reasoning":"I'll try calling vscreen_launch again since the user might have closed settings, and if that fails I'll report the error rather than attempting vscreen_screen.\n","ts":1788432970717},{"id":"252dfb87-6685-4b1f-9551-42af097e783b","role":"tool","content":"已启动 com.android.settings 到虚拟屏（displayId=130）。用 vscreen_screen 读取界面树与截图；注意：当前画面可能为纯色（本 ROM 不合成应用画面），操作以 vscreen_screen 的控件树为准。","toolCalls":[],"toolCallId":"call_0_0","toolName":"vscreen_launch","error":false,"ts":1788432973114},{"id":"9e751cb9-9a63-4ff8-8c08-55652fa2b062","role":"assistant","content":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_0_0","name":"vscreen_screen","argumentsJson":"{}"}],"error":false,"reasoning":"The virtual screen launched successfully, so I need to check what's displayed on it.","ts":1788432974820},{"id":"ead3e0eb-fb56-4c49-9394-30448c29fbe7","role":"tool","content":"共 30 个控件（用 vscreen_tap 的 index 参数直接点击）：\n[0] ScrollView \"«空»\" id=decor_content_parent (720,1600) <滚动>\n[1] RecyclerView \"«空»\" id=list (720,1817) <滚动>\n[2] RelativeLayout \"«空»\" (720,544) <点击>\n[3] SearchEditText \"搜索 / 搜索栏\" id=mc_search_edit (720,543) <点击,输入>\n[4] TextView \"\" (122,543)\n[5] FrameLayout \"语音搜索\" id=mc_voice_icon (1309,544) <点击>\n[6] TextView \"\" (1309,544)\n[7] TextView \"再见等于再也不见\" id=title (518,773)\n[8] TextView \"账号管理、云服务、支付设置和查找手机\" id=summary_vertical (718,851)\n[9] TextView \"我的手机\" id=title (727,1046)\n[10] TextView \"\" (1290,1046)\n[11] TextView \"运营商网络\" id=title (727,1371)\n[12] TextView \"\" (1290,1371)\n[13] TextView \"无线网络\" id=title (524,1588)\n[14] TextView \"CMCC-5Veg-5G\" id=summary (1033,1588)\n[15] TextView \"\" (1290,1588)\n[16] TextView \"个人热点\" id=title (524,1805)\n[17] TextView \"关闭\" id=summary (1033,1805)\n[18] TextView \"\" (1290,1805)\n[19] TextView \"蓝牙\" id=title (524,2022)\n[20] TextView \"开启\" id=summary (1033,2022)\n[21] TextView \"\" (1290,2022)\n[22] TextView \"更多连接方式\" id=title (727,2239)\n[23] TextView \"\" (1290,2239)\n[24] TextView \"Aicy 和 AI\" id=title (727,2564)\n[25] TextView \"\" (1290,2564)\n[26] TextView \"桌面、壁纸和个性化\" id=title (727,2889)\n[27] TextView \"\" (1290,2889)\n[28] TextView \"显示和亮度\" id=title (727,3106)\n[29] TextView \"\" (1290,3106)\n（截图已附上，红框标注上一步动作位置）","toolCalls":[],"toolCallId":"call_0_0","toolName":"vscreen_screen","error":false,"ts":1788432975274},{"id":"b2ca2fa6-9f60-40e9-8196-25be211b3c4e","role":"user","content":"[vscreen_screen] 页面截图（当前视觉状态，供图像分析）","toolCalls":[],"error":false,"imageData":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","ts":1788432975274},{"id":"c2970592-825f-45a4-a04c-32dfa602ec25","role":"assistant","content":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_fa5461c4dd1b418e96dc1f29","name":"vscreen_close","argumentsJson":"{}"}],"error":false,"reasoning":"Both steps of TASKX4 are complete: vscreen_launch succeeded (displayId=130), and vscreen_screen returned the control tree and screenshot. The task only asked for launch + screen. I'll report briefly. The previous task instructed to tap the first list item and then close, but this task TASKX4 only asks for launch and screen. Should I keep the virtual screen open, or close it? The instructions say \"call vscreen_launch with target com.android.settings, then run vscreen_screen. TASKX4.\" There's no mention of closing. However, as a matter of resource discipline, vscreen_close must be called after the task is completed. The task is only these two steps. To release resources, I should close it and report. Actually, the previous task (the first message) asked to tap the first item and then close. This task only asks for launch + screen. To be safe and tidy, I'll close the virtual screen and report each step.","ts":1788432980269},{"id":"11529f69-1ba9-4429-a99b-1381ecde69fc","role":"tool","content":"虚拟屏已销毁","toolCalls":[],"toolCallId":"call_fa5461c4dd1b418e96dc1f29","toolName":"vscreen_close","error":false,"ts":1788432980384},{"id":"1c81ba7b-b472-423b-8b92-5477437f3bb3","role":"assistant","content":"TASKX4 执行汇报：\n\n1. **vscreen_launch(com.android.settings)** → ✅ 成功，本次顺利投递到虚拟屏（displayId=130）。之前失败是因为设置还在主屏运行，现已避开。\n2. **vscreen_screen** → ✅ 读取到 30 个控件 + 截图。界面为魅族设置首页，列表项包括：\n   - 我的手机\n   - 运营商网络 / 无线网络（CMCC-5Veg-5G）/ 个人热点（关闭）/ 蓝牙（开启）/ 更多连接方式\n   - Aicy 和 AI / 桌面、壁纸和个性化 / 显示和亮度\n   - 顶部有搜索栏和账号卡片\"再见等于再也不见\"\n3. **vscreen_close** → ✅ 虚拟屏已销毁，资源释放。\n\n全程未占用你的主屏。需要我继续点进某个设置项看看吗？","toolCalls":[],"error":false,"reasoning":"The user asked me to run vscreen_launch, and then run vscreen_screen. Both are complete. I should report briefly. TASKX4.","promptTokens":45696,"completionTokens":551,"durationMs":14855,"model":"qwen3.8-flash","ts":1788432983821},{"id":"7e0d12c7-7ec2-44e4-9daa-d33eb17c1013","role":"user","content":"Use vscreen_launch to open com.coolapk.market, vscreen_screen to read the home feed, tap the first post, read it, then vscreen_close. Report briefly. TASKX5","toolCalls":[],"error":false,"ts":1788433490146},{"id":"fa3d0df7-0570-4dd3-82e4-0d2027da84a0","role":"assistant","content":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_17cdd1a7521d448984e6b094","name":"vscreen_launch","argumentsJson":"{\"target\": \"com.coolapk.market\"}"}],"error":false,"reasoning":"The user wants to open Coolapk (酷安) on the virtual screen, read the home feed, tap the first post, read it, and then close it. Let's start with vscreen_launch first.","ts":1788433631505},{"id":"0b1ce65c-6a7f-4926-9729-a75d38e3468f","role":"tool","content":"目标 App 未出现在虚拟屏（窗口可能被重投递回主屏或 App 拒绝多屏）。请先关闭主屏上的该 App 后重试；仍失败则改用主屏 screen/tap 工具流程。","toolCalls":[],"toolCallId":"call_17cdd1a7521d448984e6b094","toolName":"vscreen_launch","error":true,"ts":1788433638174},{"id":"a8492691-f383-48c7-abfa-7d467ac5bd51","role":"assistant","content":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_b350b6384a414ac3aad2df2a","name":"vscreen_launch","argumentsJson":"{\"target\": \"com.coolapk.market\"}"}],"error":false,"reasoning":"I should check whether CoolApk is installed or running on the main screen, and possibly retry the launch since the app might have been redirected. Let me look at the main screen state to see what's actually there, though I need to be careful about accessibility issues that could interfere with the check.","ts":1788433640958},{"id":"cbeb4d01-2e2d-4433-9aee-e98d507dac92","role":"tool","content":"目标 App 正在主屏运行：无法投递到虚拟屏（系统会把启动送回主屏实例）。请让用户先关闭主屏上的该 App，再重试；不要擅自 force-stop 打断用户当前操作。\n\n[恢复提示] 工具 vscreen_launch 已连续失败 2 次。先验证前置条件（路径存在？参数格式？权限模式？），或改用替代工具。","toolCalls":[],"toolCallId":"call_b350b6384a414ac3aad2df2a","toolName":"vscreen_launch","error":true,"ts":1788433641003},{"id":"e45cfc5e-4f45-4422-a8fd-0e736216dd57","role":"assistant","content":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_aa43c91c36ea409eb33d81c2","name":"screen","argumentsJson":"{\"max_nodes\": 10}"}],"error":false,"reasoning":"I should check whether CoolAPK is actually running on the main screen by taking a screenshot to verify the app state, since the accessibility service might be available now.","ts":1788433643277},{"id":"4b17c842-917b-4b6a-89d0-7ec8c4ea3e4a","role":"tool","content":"共 10 个控件（用 tap 的 index 参数直接点击）：\n[0] View \"«空»\" (720,1757) <滚动>\n[1] ImageView \"复制\" (67,394) <点击>\n[2] ImageView \"重新生成\" (196,394) <点击>\n[3] ImageView \"更多\" (1338,394) <点击>\n[4] TextView \"45.7k\" (171,465)\n[5] TextView \"551\" (335,465)\n[6] TextView \"37.1 tok/s\" (538,465)\n[7] TextView \"14.9s\" (758,465)\n[8] TextView \"Use vscreen_launch to open com.coolapk.market, vscreen_screen to read the home feed, tap the first post, read it, then vscreen_close. Report briefly. TASKX5\" (848,735)\n[9] ImageView \"复制\" (1115,973) <点击>","toolCalls":[],"toolCallId":"call_aa43c91c36ea409eb33d81c2","toolName":"screen","error":false,"ts":1788433643335},{"id":"435fdde4-7e69-4792-b945-7015856e012c","role":"assistant","content":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_8b370b1c08d445b4b5a7ef6f","name":"bash","argumentsJson":"{\"backend\": \"toybox\", \"command\": \"ps -A -o PID,RSS,NAME 2>/dev/null | grep -i coolapk | head -5\"}"}],"error":false,"reasoning":"The screen display is showing HaoAI's chat app, not Coolapk. The vscreen_launch error says \"目标 App 正在主屏运行 (target app is running on the main screen)\" — meaning Coolapk is running on the main screen (it might be in the background, but the system is reporting it as running). In fact, the first attempt said \"未出现在虚拟屏 (didn't appear on the virtual screen),\" and the second attempt said it was running on the main screen. The main screen is currently showing our chat app, so Coolapk might be a background instance. The tool is instructing the user to close it. I shouldn't force-stop it.\n\nOptions: ask the user to close Coolapk, or report the failure. According to the recovery hint, I should verify the preconditions. The app is probably running in the background. I could check with bash (ps), but force-stopping is not recommended (\"不要擅自 force-stop 打断用户当前操作 (don't arbitrarily force-stop and interrupt the user's current operation)\"). The user isn't visibly using Coolapk (the main screen is showing the chat), so it might be reasonable to ask the user. That said, this is a test task, and the user might be expecting me to handle it. The safest thing is: report the blocker and ask whether I should force-stop Coolapk or whether the user should close it.\n\nActually, let me check whether Coolapk is really running via bash (toybox ps or linux). The workspace shell is running in a sandbox, not on the host Android... the default bash backend is auto = linux sandbox, and I can't see host processes. The toybox backend runs on the host. Let me try `backend=toybox ps -A | grep coolapk` to check. This is a read-only operation.\n","ts":1788433688021},{"id":"f76ae062-461e-4ca2-96db-bae9bdaf8553","role":"tool","content":"exit=0\n---\n(无输出)","toolCalls":[],"toolCallId":"call_8b370b1c08d445b4b5a7ef6f","toolName":"bash","error":false,"ts":1788433688134},{"id":"af0009cf-4442-4824-99ad-dca4dc33310e","role":"assistant","content":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_85427af38c154dc080bd985e","name":"vscreen_launch","argumentsJson":"{\"target\": \"com.coolapk.market\"}"}],"error":false,"reasoning":"The coolapk process isn't showing up in the process list, which is strange since the virtual screen launch indicated it was running on the main screen. It might have been backgrounded or terminated between attempts. Let me try launching it again to see if that resolves the issue.","ts":1788433690589},{"id":"c7904349-234a-46e0-9ac0-5c120e76977f","role":"tool","content":"目标 App 正在主屏运行：无法投递到虚拟屏（系统会把启动送回主屏实例）。请让用户先关闭主屏上的该 App，再重试；不要擅自 force-stop 打断用户当前操作。\n\n[升级] 该步骤已失败 3 次。禁止用相同参数重试。二选一：a) 换方法达成同一目标；b) 直接向用户说明阻塞点并请求指示。","toolCalls":[],"toolCallId":"call_85427af38c154dc080bd985e","toolName":"vscreen_launch","error":true,"ts":1788433690650}],"deletedAt":0,"titleAuto":true,"pinned":false,"runState":"running","runGoal":"Use vscreen_launch to open com.coolapk.market, vscreen_screen to read the home feed, tap the first post, read it, then vscreen_close. Report briefly. TASKX5","runTurnsUsed":4,"activeGroups":["core","extended"]}